POST LETTERS 1985-04-02 12:00 EDITORS
SUBJECT HELLO FROM THE EDITORS
WELCOME TO OUR BOARD. HERE YOU CAN WRITE TO US WITHOUT A STAMP, AND FETCH THE LISTINGS OF EVERY ISSUE WITHOUT TYPING THEM IN.
BUT DO TYPE ONE IN NOW AND THEN. IT IS HOW YOU LEARN.
.

POST LETTERS 1985-05-17 19:25 MARINA
SUBJECT TROIKA IS TOO HARD
I SOLVED LEVEL 5 OF TROIKA AFTER TWO EVENINGS. MY BROTHER SAYS THERE IS A TRICK WITH THE C BUTTON. IS THERE?
.

POST LETTERS 1985-05-20 09:10 EDITORS
SUBJECT RE: TROIKA IS TOO HARD
THERE IS NO TRICK, ONLY A HINT: C FLIPS - AND +, BUT LEAVES 0 ALONE. TRY TO MAKE A ROW OF ONLY - AND + FIRST.
.

POST LISTINGS 1985-08-30 16:45 ARKADY
SUBJECT WHAT DOES MAYBE DO
IN THE TERNCLOCK LISTING THERE IS AN IF WITH A MAYBE. MY BOOK FROM SCHOOL ONLY KNOWS THEN AND ELSE. WHERE DOES THE PROGRAM GO?
.

POST LISTINGS 1985-09-02 10:00 EDITORS
SUBJECT RE: WHAT DOES MAYBE DO
WHEN THE CONDITION IS UNKNOWN, NEITHER TRUE NOR FALSE, THE PROGRAM GOES TO MAYBE. YOUR SCHOOL BOOK IS FOR TWO-STATE MACHINES. THIS ONE HAS THREE.
.

